  - name: Feedhub Net Down
    detail: Feedhub is unreachable
    fluxfile: flux/feedhub_net_down.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 1
    calendar: OfficeHours 
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - server
      - port 
      - service
    interval: 300
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              This indicates that Feedhub is not reachable from one or more servers. This may be a temporary disruption of traffic. 
              Log into the affected VM and manually test connectivity. An extended failure to connect or repeated alerts should be
              escalated to Azure Network Support and/or the client. Feedhub uses port 22 on IP adresses: 168.108.161.83 (MCC) and
              168.108.225.214 (SCC)
